@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001/api/v1

### Check if table is available for time range
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/check-availability?table_id=TABLE_ID&reservation_date=2025-12-25&reservation_time=19:00&reservation_checkout_time=21:00

### Check availability - Table available
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/check-availability?table_id=TABLE_ID&reservation_date=2026-01-15&reservation_time=18:00&reservation_checkout_time=20:00

### Check availability - Different date (no conflict)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/check-availability?table_id=TABLE_ID&reservation_date=2026-02-01&reservation_time=19:00&reservation_checkout_time=21:00

### Check availability - Overlapping time (conflict expected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/check-availability?table_id=TABLE_ID&reservation_date=2025-12-25&reservation_time=20:00&reservation_checkout_time=22:00

### Check availability - Missing parameters (should return 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/reservations/check-availability?table_id=TABLE_ID&reservation_date=2025-12-25
